            "review_text": "ryankylie\nCaringbah, Australia107 contributions\n0\nDelicious meal with lots of variety for everyone in the family.\nDec 2025 • Family\nDelicious meal with lots of variety for everyone in the family. \n\nFamily-owned spots like these deliver consistent quality, from excellent vermicelli salads and cam to g noodles to attentive service without being overbearing. We went here twice and loved the authentic flavors in dishes like vermicelli bowls, lotus salads, and pork dishes. These elements make it a must-visit for Vietnamese cuisine lovers.\nWritten December 28, 2025",
