            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Co Ba Vung Tau",
            "review_text": "Phuketwergoing\nSurfers Paradise, Australia1054 contributions\n0\nYum......\nAug 2023 • Couples\nHad read about this restaurant, and was really keen to try Banh Khot, which is apparently the speciality of the area. There are a few places with similar names, and the photos on here are conflicting. However, we did find the right one and got a taxi there, as the weather was threatening again.\nOn arrival we were welcomed by a lovely young lady, I think her name was Ngoc Diep. Sorry if that's wrong. She asked if we had eaten Bahn Khot before and we said no. We ordered a plate of shrimp Bahn khot and a plate of mixed, as well as two beers.\nThis lovely girl was so happy to give us a heads up on the sauces, the right sauce to eat, what was in the fish sauce, how to wrap the Bahn Khot, and what the herbs were.Yum...just yum. We really enjoyed all the flavours and the freshness with herbs.\n\nThis is a fab restaurant, and I would recommend anyone in Vung Tau visit here and get fabulous food and even better service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 27, 2023",
