            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Co Ba Vung Tau",
            "review_text": "Washington Irving\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese Dining Experience: Great food!\nJun 2022\nAs per many Vietnamese restaurants, the menu is pretty much in the name. So only go there for great Banh Khot or Banh Xeo. The service is efficient but not friendly, but that's pretty typical. The food is really very good; the Banh Khot are light on toppings (prawns, beef, pork) but are a treat in and of themselves; especially coupled with the fresh greens and herbs. Good prices, great and fresh food, and service that works; a great place for a quick and yummy, authentic meal in VT.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 21, 2022",
